\loch\hich\dbch\pard\plain\ltrpar\itap0{\lang1033\fs30\f2\cf0 \cf0\ql{\fs28\f3 {\ltrch This dialog shows a view of the content of the Universal Knowledge Store (UKS) which is a graph composed of Thoughts and Links which connect them.  Unlike most modules, you may have any number of UKS module instances open for multiple views into the same data.  You can expand items in the tree view.   }\li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs40\f4 {\cf2\ltrch Thought/Link Display Tree-View }\li0\ri0\sa80\sb360\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\ltrch      Each line in the tree-view represents a single Atomic Thought which is displayed as its label, OR (if the Thought represents a link) the form: [source\u8594?type\u8594?target]. "Is-a" relationships are shown by indenting so "Fido" indented below "dog" represents [Fido\u8594?is-a\u8594?dog].}\li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\ltrch      Each Thought may be expanded by double-clicking or clicking the small triangle at the left of the Thought. }\li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\ltrch      Thoughts are alphabetized by label.  Links first.}\li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\ltrch      }{\b\ltrch Color:}{\ltrch  }\li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\ltrch Green: Thought or Link has recently been accessed/added/changed. }\li360\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx360\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\ltrch Yellow: Link is about to be deleted.}\li360\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx360\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\ltrch      The details of the display can be controlled by the various option check-boxes in the dialog header (see below)}\li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs40\f4 {\cf2\ltrch Context Menus}\li0\ri0\sa80\sb360\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\ltrch      Right-click any Thought in the tree-view to show its context menu.}\li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\ltrch      For a non-link Thought, elements are:}\li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\ltrch The Thought label and its index in the AllThoughts array (internal).}\li720\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx720\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\ltrch The editable Thought label: Case is preserved but searches are case-insensitive. If the name already exists in the UKS, digits will be appended to make it unique.}\li720\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx720\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\ltrch Expand all descendants: Only one thought can be fully expanded at a time.}\li720\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx720\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\ltrch Delete: Deletes the Thought and all its children}\li720\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx720\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\ltrch Delete Child: deletes the is-a link which attaches this Thought to its parent.  }\li720\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx720\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\ltrch Make Root: Makes this Thought the root of the tree view.}\li720\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx720\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\ltrch Show All: Makes the Thought labeled \ldblquote Thought\rdblquote  the root of the tree view.}\li720\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx720\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\ltrch Parents: All parents are shown.  Clicking on one makes it the root of the tree view.}\li720\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx720\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\b\ltrch For a Link:}{\ltrch  the menu displays the link weight and time to live, a delete option and links to set the display root to the source, type, or target thoughts.}\li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs40\f4 {\cf2\ltrch Top Panel}\li0\ri0\sa80\sb360\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\ltrch Buttons:}\li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\b\ltrch Initialize}{\ltrch : Creates a UKS with just a few basic elements. }\li360\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx360\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\b\ltrch Import: }{\ltrch Reads the content of a .txt file into the UKS.}\li360\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx360\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\b\ltrch Export:}{\ltrch  Creates a .txt file of the content which is currently in the tree-view.}\li360\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx360\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\ltrch TextBox}\li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\b\ltrch Root:}{\ltrch  Type in the name of the Thought to be the root of the Tree view. Setting this to blank shows any Thoughts which have no parents (for debugging).}\li360\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx360\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\ltrch Checkboxes}\li360\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\b\ltrch Auto-refresh}{\ltrch  / Refresh button: When the checkbox is checked, the tree view refreshes every 200 ms. When it is not checked, use the Refresh button to update the display.}\li360\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx360\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\b\ltrch Show Details:}{\ltrch  Shows or hide the confidence values associated with each Link. The confidence for Thoughts is the confidence value of the Link which makes it a child.}\li360\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx360\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\b\ltrch Reverse Links: }{\ltrch When checked, the tree-view will include links to thoughts as well as links from thoughts.}\li360\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx360\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\b\ltrch Show Conditionals: }{\ltrch Allow display of the conditions of compound links.}\li360\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx360\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 \li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs28\f3 \li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
}
}

