\loch\hich\dbch\pard\plain\ltrpar\itap0{\lang1033\fs30\f2\cf0 \cf0\ql{\fs40\f3 {\cf2\ltrch Well-Being}\li0\ri0\sa80\sb360\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs24\f4 {\ltrch This control represents the system\rquote s current level of well-being.}\li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs24\f4 {\ltrch Changes in well-being are used for reinforcement learning \emdash  helping the system learn which actions are beneficial.}\li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs24\f4 {\ltrch When an action is taken, any increase or decrease in well-being is associated with:}\li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs24\f4 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\ltrch the current context (what was happening)}\li720\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx720\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs24\f4 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\ltrch the action taken}\li720\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx720\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs24\f4 {\ltrch Over time, the system strengthens actions that improve well-being and weakens those that do not.}\li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs24\f4 {\ltrch In this way, behavior is not pre-programmed.}{\ltrch \line }{\ltrch It emerges from experience.}\li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs24\f4 \li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
}
}

