\loch\hich\dbch\pard\plain\ltrpar\itap0{\lang1033\fs30\f2\cf0 \cf0\ql{\fs40\f3 {\cf2\ltrch Action Selection}\li0\ri0\sa80\sb360\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs24\f4 {\ltrch This module selects an action based on the current context.}\li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs24\f4 {\ltrch For a given context, the system chooses among possible actions, typically favoring those that have previously led to improved well-being.}\li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs24\f4 {\ltrch After an action is taken, the result is }{\b\ltrch not evaluated immediately}{\ltrch .}{\ltrch \line }{\ltrch Instead, the system waits for a change in well-being.}\li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs24\f4 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\ltrch If well-being improves, the association between the context and the action is strengthened.}\li720\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx720\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs24\f4 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\ltrch If well-being decreases, the association is weakened.}\li720\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx720\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs24\f4 {\pntext \'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart1{\pntxtb\'B7}}{\ltrch If no change occurs within a short time, the result may be treated as neutral.}\li720\ri0\sa160\sb0\jclisttab\tx720\fi-360\ql\par}
{\fs24\f4 {\ltrch This delay is important. It allows the system to learn from the }{\b\ltrch consequences}{\ltrch  of its actions, not just the actions themselves.}\li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs24\f4 {\ltrch Over time, the system learns which actions are most effective in each situation.}\li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
{\fs24\f4 \li0\ri0\sa160\sb0\fi0\ql\par}
}
}

